	(text_box "DESIGN NOTES - ESP32-C6\n\nCOPY FROM REFERENCE BOARD: ESP32-C6 co-processor, SDIO to P4 (esp_hosted), antenna/matching.\nC6 EN and GPIO9 (BOOT): open-drain from P4 AND from FT4232H ch D (DTR/RTS auto-reset).\nC6 USB (GPIO12 D-, GPIO13 D+) -> Dev hub port 2.\nC6 UART0 (GPIO16 TX, GPIO17 RX) -> buffer -> FT4232H ch D.\nSupply 3V3_C6 (PM2 ch3)."
